3.
(For Question 3 and Question 4)Case Study: XYZ lnternational Gastronomy Festival Tickets Selling System"
List EIGHT (B) stakeholders of the new XYZ lnternationalGastronomy Festival Tickets Selling System.Draw a context diagram of the new XYZ lnternationalGastronomy Festival Tickets Selling System. Make sure you labelthe actors, the relationships between them as well as theirrelationships to the system.
c. According to the case study, identify:i. ONE (1) goal.ii. TWO (2i functional requirements.iii.Tltio {?-) nan-fu nctional requi rements.N ilai University/Acaciernie/Set 1
XYZ lnternational Gastronomy Festival is a famous foodie festival, held in everyyear. Since its first edition in 20'17, it has gone through several major changesregarding its structure, length and loration, but the tickets have always been soldin a traditional way: through two events agencies. The crganizers Cecidecj tocompletely modernize the tickets selling system and created the followingconcept.
From this year on, the tickets will be sold in two distinct ways: traditionally, i.e. bythe one event agency and in electronic format directly on the festival website. Allpafties will have access to the same unique tickets database of the new system, toavoid double selling. Moreover, the system will have to be extended to support notonly in Arabic language, but also in English, French and ltalian. Since tickets willalso be sold online, SecurePayment Inc. will be contracted to provide and ensurethe security of the online payment service. The XYZ event manager will take careand negotiate all these details with the involved parties.Additionally, upon arrival at the festival venue, each participant has to self-iheck inat a touch screen terminal, which scans the barcodes on his/her ticket and issues abracelet with an electronic chip. This can be used to load nroney, such thatwhenever (s)he wants to purchase snacks or beverages, (s)he does not have to usecash anymore, thus reducing waiting times. This measure was initiated by theprogram manager and will be deployed by WristSolutions lnc. Lastly, according tothe cantonal laws, the way the payment transactions are performed has to beaudited by an external company at the end of the festival, since this is a publicevent"
b.
(8 MARKS)
(10 MARKSi
(r MARK)(3 MARKS)(3 MARK5)Page 2 of -a

